{
  "name": "usage-analyser",
  "title": "Usage analyser (experimental)",
  "description": "Usage analyser (experimental): token, cost, cache and time findings; ideas for other analyses are welcome. An owner-only page runs a child process that reads Pi Pocket records, never keeps or shows message text, and stores a cache in <data>/usage-analyser/. Ask PiP sends findings to PiP. sessions() is experimental; /pip.js and the pocket.sqlite record shapes are internal and can change in any release. The analyser makes no network requests; PiP may send findings to its model provider.",
